          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 01 2022 18:02:36 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">You can never have<br>\n too much</span><span class=\"futura-bold\"> confidence.</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Accurate and reproducible measurement in 1mm increments</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Clear digital readout allowing improved visibility for depth measurement</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Removes errors commonly associated with a manual depth gauge</span></span><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 19 2023 21:01:04 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
