          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 01 2022 18:02:36 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Drilling and measurement<br>\n </span><span class=\"futura-bold\">done as one.</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Streamlined instrumentation and surgical steps - one-step drilling and measurement</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Automatic cortex to cortex measurement and digital readout&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Up to 99mm of live depth</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Removes user-to-user variability in depth measurement&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 13 2023 08:27:37 GMT+0000",
