          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Simple. Seamless.<br>\n </span><span class=\"futura-bold\">No matter the system.</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Works independently of the implant system allowing for use across the market</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Can be used for both locking and non-locking screws&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Compatible with legacy cordless driver attachments</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Drill bit diameters range from 1.5-4.5mm and varying lengths</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 13 2023 08:28:36 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
