          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Plating that </span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">fits.</span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n </span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">CD NXT may be used with Stryker and other manufacturer's implant systems.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Only by truly understanding the challenges you face can we offer a portfolio to best fit your needs. With anatomically contoured plates designed or validated using our proprietary SOMA technology, streamlined instrumentation, and trained representatives, our plating portfolio is designed with you in mind.<br>\n&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n",
