          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Meet the rest of the <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">System 9 family.</span></span><br>\n </span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Built on trust. Empowering you.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Charge with a more intuitive interface and confirm battery status pre-procedure. Hold onto the handpiece’s more holistic, ergonomic design to accommodate inverted cutting. See battery power at a glance and know your power tool is ready to perform. These are just a few of ways System 9 puts your needs first.<br>\n &nbsp;</span></span></p>\n",
